: hello everyone, if you ask why I can't log in as a developer right now, the main file gives compilation error for several reasons, I came to see if there is a problem until I solve it, by the way, one of the admins should indicate in the game message that the update may be delayed due to problems.
By the way, don't worry, everything is under control, let me show you a few upcoming features, new in version 8.0.
*More bugs fixed!
*added more dlls, they will ease the loading of maps and sounds
Inventory editing system has been added, so you can now easily find an item!
*The inventory has been recoded, made compatible with the hand system
Added category system to inventory
added left hand, and, right hand, warning, there may be bugs with hands, remember, these are new additions, if you find any bugs feel free to report
added sounds uploader, now instead of spending internet to download sounds, we will only download new sounds, encoding, buzreisi
*The updater has been recoded!
added read me updater!
*cfu menu re-coded!
voting has finished
in conclusion
map feature will be developed
In addition, the features you see in many games will be added.
Anyway
they are surprise
